{"hymn":"S53","parent":"E67","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Cuán dulce el nombre de Jesús","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":"¡Cuán","n2":["dul","i"],"n3":["ce‿el","t"],"n4":["nom","i"],"n5":["bre","t"],"n6":"de","n7":["Je","i"],"n8":["sús!","t"],"n9":"Su","n10":["mú","i"],"n11":["si","m"],"n12":["ca‿a","m"],"n13":["mo","t"],"n14":["en","i"],"n15":["to","m"],"n16":["nar,","t"],"n17":"De","n18":["go","i"],"n19":["zo","t"],"n20":["me‿ha","i"],"n21":["ce","t"],"n22":["des","i"],"n23":["bor","m"],"n24":["dar,","t"],"n25":["Je","i"],"n26":["sús,","t"],"n27":["pre","i"],"n28":["cio","m"],"n29":["so","t"],"n30":["nom","i"],"n31":["bre!","t"],"n32":["¡Je","i"],"n33":["sús!","t"],"n34":["Nom","i"],"n35":["bre","t"],"n36":["dul","i"],"n37":["ce","t"],"n38":"es.","n39":["¡Je","i"],"n40":["sús!","t"],"n41":["Ca","i"],"n42":["da","t"],"n43":["dí","i"],"n44":["a‿i","m"],"n45":["gual.","t"],"n46":["¡Je","i"],"n47":["sús!","t"],"n48":["San","i"],"n49":["tos","t"],"n50":["pro","i"],"n51":["cla","m"],"n52":["mad:","t"],"n53":"Es","n54":["dig","i"],"n55":["no","t"],"n56":["de‿a","i"],"n57":["la","m"],"n58":["ban","m"],"n59":["za.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Yo amo el nombre de Jesús,","Conoce y lleva mi dolor,","De mi‿ansiedad quita el temor,","¡Jesús, amado nombre!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Amo‿escuchar el nombre aquel,","Que siempre‿alegra el corazón,","Y seca‿el llanto su canción,","¡Oh, exaltad Su nombre!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Nadie podrá jamás decir","Cuán dulce el nombre‿es para mí;","Oh, cuánto hay que bendecir,","¡Jesús, Tu dulce nombre!"]}]}